---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
		<style>
			.hero {
				text-align: center;
				padding: 4em 0;
			}
			.hero h1 {
				font-size: 4em;
				margin-bottom: 0.2em;
				background: linear-gradient(to right, #F8FAFC, var(--accent));
				-webkit-background-clip: text;
				-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
			}
			.hero p {
				font-size: 1.2em;
				color: var(--text-muted);
				max-width: 600px;
				margin: 0 auto 3em auto;
			}
			.cta-btn {
				display: inline-block;
				background-color: var(--accent);
				color: var(--bg-dark) !important;
				padding: 1em 2em;
				border-radius: 8px;
				font-weight: 800;
				font-size: 1.1em;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				letter-spacing: 1px;
				text-decoration: none;
				box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 255, 163, 0.4);
				transition: all 0.3s ease;
			}
			.cta-btn:hover {
				transform: translateY(-3px);
				box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 255, 163, 0.6);
				background-color: var(--accent-dark);
			}
			.features {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
				gap: 2em;
				margin-top: 4em;
			}
			.feature-card {
				background-color: var(--bg-card);
				padding: 2.5em;
				border-radius: 12px;
				border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
			}
			.feature-card h3 {
				color: var(--accent);
				margin-bottom: 1em;
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<section class="hero">
				<h1>Tech Oculta</h1>
				<p>O submundo do hardware e da tecnologia. Análises sinceras, reviews detalhados e as melhores ofertas garimpadas para o seu setup.</p>
				<a href="/blog" class="cta-btn">Explorar Ofertas 🔥</a>
			</section>

			<section class="features">
				<div class="feature-card">
					<h3>💡 Reviews de Hardware</h3>
					<p>Testamos placas de vídeo, processadores e periféricos para descobrir o verdadeiro custo-benefício que as marcas tentam esconder.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="feature-card">
					<h3>💰 Ofertas Verificadas</h3>
					<p>Monitoramos o mercado diariamente para trazer links diretos de ofertas na Amazon que realmente valem a pena para o seu bolso.</p>
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
